   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Indigenous Education Councils presented proposals on education for the law which include indigenous demands. A one year extension support was provided to the CEPOs, together with Holland and Denmark, in support of their Annual Plan 2006-2007, with the objective that CEPOs contribute to the formulation of guidelines for  pluriculturalism and bilingual education.</narrative>
